OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang quits in wake
OL,4,Aof affair with suspected Chinese spy,
OL,5,Aas firm's stocks plunge
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays, with chief financial officer
OL,10,FColette Kress appointed interim boss
OL,12,FThe company's shares have recovered
OL,13,Fsome ground after plummeting more than
OL,14,F13% when US markets opened shortly
OL,15,Fafter news of Huang's resignation
OL,17,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted an affair
OL,18,Fwith a woman, who was reportedly from
OL,19,Fanother company and suspected to be a
OL,20,FChinese spy
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
