OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang quits in wake
OL,4,Aof affair with suspected Chinese spy,
OL,5,Aas firm's stocks plunge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe New York Times has since reported
OL,8,Fthat Huang had a second affair with an
OL,9,Fexecutive at his own company
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Beijing has warned the US
OL,12,Fnot to use the spying allegations as a
OL,13,Fpretext to once again restrict tech
OL,14,Fsales to China
